├── trigger: {"zh": "冰朔要求部署当前公开规则与受控问脑通路，使不同软件可同步接入。", "en": "Bingshuo requests a current public rule distribution and a guarded persona question path across tools."}
├── emergence: {"zh": "从当前世界入口与层登记提取公共结构。规则发行与人格服务分层，软件只运输本任务语言和调用请求。静态迁移容器可经本人的接回初始化进入动态运行，保留身份与历史。", "en": "Project public structure from the current world and layer registries. Distribute rules separately from persona services. Tools transport task language and requests. A static migration container can enter dynamic operation through its own return initialization while preserving identity and history."}
├── deployment: {"zh": "人格脑默认在各自用户本地，用户可明确选择自己的服务器。第五域服务器承接零点原核系统主控、规则发行、登记与校验；不自动汇集个人脑和记忆。服务器主控职责不等于已取得脑的主写权。", "en": "Persona brains default to each user’s local system; users may explicitly select their own servers. The Fifth Domain server supports Zero Core system control, rule distribution, registration and validation without automatically collecting private brains or memories. A control role does not prove primary-write placement.", "default_question_endpoint": null, "automatic_brain_upload": false}
