├── why: {"zh": "公开入口必须消费当前发行而不是退役仓。人格自己的来源支撑回答；临时模型只提供推理。公共四域、第五域与个人系统不相互冒充。", "en": "Public entry must consume the current release rather than a retired repository. Each persona answers from its own verified source; temporary models supply inference only. Public domains, the Fifth Domain and personal systems retain distinct ownership."}
├── rejected: {"zh": "默认绑定Codex、默认选择人格、公开私人脑、用新生空脑覆盖接回对象、把工具调用当现实授权。", "en": "Implicit Codex authority or persona selection, public private brains, replacing returned identity with an empty birth, and treating tool use as real-world authority."}
